error[L0508]: `apples` is passed with `variable` and also used elsewhere in the same expression
  --> tests/check/evaluation_order.lym:13:40
   |
13 |     constant total = apples + take_one(variable apples)
   |                                        ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ `take_one` may change `apples` here
   |                      ------ `apples` is used here too, so the result depends on which runs first
   |
help: make the call a statement of its own and save any result in a `constant`; the statements after it see the new `apples`

